==Restrictions==
Deploy from Row 1 only

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 12~16.67 seconds<sup>360f~500f</sup>.
*7 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 14.67~20 seconds<sup>440f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[King's Mimic]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

